{"speciesId":173,"names":{"fr":"Mélo","es":"Cleffa","en":"Cleffa","ja":"ピィ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Because of its unusual, star-like silhouette, people believe that it came here on a meteor."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"When numerous me­ teors illuminate the night sky, sightings of CLEFFA strangely increase."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"If the impact site of a meteorite is found, this POKéMON is certain to be within the immediate area."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"On nights with many shooting stars, CLEFFA can be seen dancing in a ring. They dance through the night and stop only at the break of day, when these POKéMON quench their thirst with the morning dew."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"On nights with many shooting stars, CLEFFA can be seen dancing in a ring. They dance through the night and stop only at the break of day, when these POKéMON quench their thirst with the morning dew."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"On nights with many shooting stars, CLEFFA can be seen dancing in a ring. They dance until daybreak, when they quench their thirst with the morning dew."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"When numerous meteors illuminate the night sky, sightings of CLEFFA strangely increase."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Because of its unusual, starlike silhouette, people believe that it came here on a meteor."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its silhouette is like a star. It is believed to arrive riding on shooting stars."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Many appear when the night skies are filled with shooting stars. They disappear with sunrise."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is often seen when shooting stars fill the night skies. It’s said to arrive riding on a shooting star."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Because of its unusual, starlike silhouette, people believe that it came here on a meteor."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"When numerous meteors illuminate the night sky, sightings of CLEFFA strangely increase."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On dit qu’il se déplace à dos d’étoile filante. Il se montre souvent quand on en voit."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is often seen when shooting stars fill the night skies. It’s said to arrive riding on a shooting star."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"On dit qu’il se déplace à dos d’étoile filante. Il se montre souvent quand on en voit."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is often seen when shooting stars fill the night skies. It’s said to arrive riding on a shooting star."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"According to local rumors, Cleffa are often seen in places where shooting stars have fallen."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"According to local rumors, Cleffa are often seen in places where shooting stars have fallen."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il ressemble un peu à une étoile. On suppose qu’il est venu sur terre accroché à une météorite."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Por su inusual forma estrellada, la gente cree que procede de un meteorito que cayó a la tierra."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Because of its unusual, starlike silhouette, people believe that it came here on a meteor."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"お星さまのような シルエット。 その姿から 流れ星に乗って やって来ると 信じられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"On en voit beaucoup lorsque le ciel se remplit d’étoiles filantes. Ils s’éclipsent au lever du soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Muchos aparecen cuando hay estrellas fugaces en el cielo nocturno. Se esfuman al amanecer."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Many appear when the night skies are filled with shooting stars. They disappear with sunrise."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"流れ星の 多い 夜は ピィが たくさん 姿を 見せる。 朝日が 昇ると いなくなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les nuits où il y a des étoiles filantes, on peut voir des Mélo danser en cercle. Ils dansent toute la nuit et ne s’arrêtent qu’à l’aube. Ces Pokémon se désaltèrent alors avec la rosée du matin."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuando hay lluvia de estrellas, a los Cleffa se les puede ver danzando en círculos durante toda la noche. Solo paran cuando rompe el día; entonces, dejan de bailar y calman su sed con el rocío de la mañana."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On nights with many shooting stars, Cleffa can be seen dancing in a ring. They dance through the night and stop only at the break of day, when these Pokémon quench their thirst with the morning dew."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"流れ星の 多い 夜は 輪に なって 踊る ピィの 姿を みることが できる。 日の出まで 踊り 夜露で のどを 潤す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les nuits où il y a des étoiles filantes, on peut voir des Mélo danser en cercle. Ils dansent toute la nuit et ne s’arrêtent qu’à l’aube. Ces Pokémon se désaltèrent alors avec la rosée du matin."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando hay lluvia de estrellas, a los Cleffa se les puede ver danzando en círculos durante toda la noche. Solo paran cuando rompe el día; entonces, dejan de bailar y calman su sed con el rocío de la mañana."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On nights with many shooting stars, Cleffa can be seen dancing in a ring. They dance through the night and stop only at the break of day, when these Pokémon quench their thirst with the morning dew."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"流れ星の 多い 夜は 輪に なって 踊る ピィの 姿を みることが できる。 日の出まで 踊り 夜露で のどを 潤す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"On dit que s’il contemple fixement le ciel lorsque des étoiles filantes passent, c’est parce que cela lui rappelle son bercail."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se dice que este Pokémon se acuerda de su hogar cuando observa el cielo durante una lluvia de estrellas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"On late nights illuminated by shooting stars, it gazes intently skyward, as if thinking of its home."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"流星の 煌めく 深夜に じっと 空を 眺める 姿は 故郷に 思いを 馳せているよう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Selon certaines croyances, sa forme prouve qu’il s’agit de la réincarnation d’une étoile. Étrangement, il aime beaucoup les Météno."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Algunos creen que su forma es un indicio de que Cleffa es, en realidad, la reencarnación de una estrella. Por algún motivo, adora a los Minior."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Because of its silhouette, it’s believed to be a star reborn. For some reason, it loves Minior."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"そのシルエットから お星様の 生まれ変わりと 信じられている。 なぜか メテノが 大好き。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Les nuits où les étoiles filantes inondent le ciel, il danse en cercle avec ses congénères. On dit qu’admirer ce spectacle porte bonheur."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Las noches de lluvia de estrellas, se congregan y bailan en círculo. Se cree que presenciar este espectáculo trae buena suerte."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"On nights with many shooting stars, they gather in packs and dance in circles. If you should see them, something good will happen!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"流れ星の 多い 夜に 群れ 輪になって ダンス。 その 姿を 見ると ちょっと いいことが あるよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il serait parvenu jusqu’à nous en chevauchant une étoile filante. On le trouve dans les endroits où des météorites sont tombées."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Se dice que llegó en una estrella fugaz. Este Pokémon suele encontrarse en lugares donde han caído meteoritos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Said to have ridden here on a shooting star, Cleffa seem to appear in places where meteorites have struck in the past."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"流れ星に 乗ってきたと いわれる。 ピィが 現れるのは 昔 隕石が 落ちた 場所 らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"On dit qu’il apparaît souvent là où se sont écrasées des météorites."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Los lugareños rumorean que suele encontrarse en lugares donde han caído estrellas fugaces."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"According to local rumors, Cleffa are often seen in places where shooting stars have fallen."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"ピィを よく 見かける 場所は 流れ星が 落ちた 場所と 地元では うわさ されている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il ressemble un peu à une étoile. On suppose qu’il est venu sur terre accroché à une météorite."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Por su inusual forma estrellada, la gente cree que procede de un meteorito que cayó a la tierra."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Because of its unusual, starlike silhouette, people believe that it came here on a meteor."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"お星さまのような シルエット。 その姿から 流れ星に乗って やって来ると 信じられている。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"In silhouette, they resemble twinkling starlight. When shooting stars rain from the night sky, Cleffa gather in numbers and dance as though they are indeed incarnations of the stars."}],"varieties":[{"id":173,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0]]}